	(text "Trim network calculation:\nAssume RV1 is a voltage source with Ro=0, for this R13>>RV1\n\nVin_{range}= (Vin_{max}-Vin_{min})\nWhere Vin_{range} - range of input voltage from RV1;\nVin_{max} - the maximum input voltage from RV1 (10V);\nVin_{min} - minimum input voltage from RV1 (0V).\n\n"
